+| Input | K result | Mathematical value | Independent oracle |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| `[1,2,3,4]` | `rat(1024,1024)` | `1` | `1` |
+| `[5]` | `rat(0,1)` | `0` | `0` |
+| `[-2,0,2]` | `rat(108,81)` | `4/3` | `4/3` |
+| `[1/2,3/2]` | `rat(256,512)` | `1/2` | `1/2` |
