Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Fresh reconstruction produced `#Top`, and the false-result mutation was correctly rejected. However, the generated `absNum` semantics is unsound for admitted negative-denominator rationals: input `[-3,-1]` returns MAD `−1` instead of `+1`.

See [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md) and the preserved [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/05_unsound_witness.log).
